                "markdown": "# GHBB SARIF help Markdown baseline\n\n**Marker:** `GHBB-SARIF-HELP-MARKDOWN-20260917-S1`\n\n<span id=\"ghbb-sarif-help-span-20260917-s1\">GHBB-SARIF-HELP-SPAN-20260917-S1</span>\n\n[GHBB-SARIF-HELP-LINK-20260917-S1](https://github.com/chaoticv/github-actions-renderer-research/tree/ghbb-sarif-help-markdown-20260917-s1)\n\n<details><summary>GHBB-SARIF-HELP-DETAILS-SUMMARY-20260917-S1</summary>\n\nGHBB-SARIF-HELP-DETAILS-BODY-20260917-S1\n\n</details>"
